 is filled with frenzy inflicted rats  take out the rats and the khalid  baptismal church's sacred tear is yours  for the taking  heading into limb crave and closer to  the earth tree we find the third church  of america as i said we're closer to the  start of america's religion the third  church of america can be found just  north of mistwood and in order to get  there you'll just have to head north  from the waypoint ruins cellar site of  grace where sorcerers selling in the mad  pumpkin head are located along the path  and then east of lake achill's bridge  head past the artist shack site of grace  and you'll end up at the church the  church is a vital find as it not only  has a sacred tier but also the flask of  wondrous physic a one-time use  customizable flask that recharges every  time you rest at a site of grace  heading north we reach leone of the  lakes just west of the first sight of  grace you'll find here the lake facing  cliff side of grace you'll find the  church of irith or here on a map  the church of earth houses the sorcerer  topes who will sell you sorceries after  paying him ten runes and hint to you the  way to enter the academy of real lucaria  the church of earth also happens to  house your fifth sacred tier  on the northeast side of lyria on the  way to the grand lift of dectus you'll  find the bellum church located right  here on a map  here you'll find your sixth sacred tier  the seventh sacred tier can be a little  more annoying to find but definitely  worth the hassle it's also located on  the northeast side of lyria here on a  map  in order to get to it you'll have to  wrap around northeast of bellum church  then east of the ground lift of dectus  and back south again on the way you'll  find the eye of sauron or a guard tower  that is regularly casting a madness  inflicting spell at the top  run past this and through the frenzied  flame village then up the cliff you'll  be invaded by festering fingerprint vike  beyond him is the church 