 borealis of the freezing fog at the  southeast edge of the freezing lake  you'll find your 11th sacred tier within  the first church america located here on  the map  we come to the 12th and final sacred  tier also found at the mountaintops of  the giants this time you'll have to head  further south from the first church  america and into the flame peak once  you're close to the church the bloody  finger okinaw will invade you he's  guarding the church of repose and the  location of your final sacred tier  the church of repose can be found here  on the map  i hope this guide was helpful to you  we'll be updating our golden seed guide  to include every golden seed so make  sure to check that out as well as a  plethora of other elden ring content we  have readily available for you and in  the works and i'll see you guys next  time peace  you
 

